<title>USA: Dart Group buys rest of supermarket chain.</title>
<headline>Dart Group buys rest of supermarket chain.</headline>
<dateline>LANDOVER, Md. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dart Group Corp said Thursday it had acquired the 50 percent interest in Shoppers Food Warehouse Corp it did not already own for $210 million.</p>
<p>Shoppers operates 34 supermarkets in the greater Washington area.</p>
<p>Dart said it had named its chief financial officer, Mark Flint, chief executive of Shoppers.</p>
